* A reporting query affects the performance of transactional operations. How would you separate or optimize the workloads?
* Your database storage is growing rapidly because old transaction records are retained indefinitely. How would you manage retention and archiving?
* A migration introduces a new mandatory column and breaks older application instances. How would you prevent this during deployment?
* A Redis cache contains outdated values after database updates. How would you keep cached data consistent?
* Your application needs to process millions of records overnight. How would you design batch processing without exhausting memory or database connections?
* A database backup completes successfully, but restoration fails during a disaster-recovery test. How would you improve the backup strategy?
* A sharded database receives most requests on a single shard. How would you diagnose and resolve the data-distribution problem?
* Your application requires globally unique identifiers across multiple database shards. How would you generate them?
